仪","采用泵吸式采样，按目标气体选配传感器，便于移动检测与现场巡检。彩色显示屏呈现测量信息，并提供声音、灯光及振动报警，辅助操作人员识别监测状态。",{"_57":164,"_223":-5,"_217":116,"_147":-5,"_144":269},{"_103":116,"_147":-5,"_149":-5,"_150":151},{"_160":271,"_140":172,"_173":272,"_175":253,"_177":273,"_179":274,"_181":275,"_183":276,"_185":277,"_187":278,"_189":279},"2c4a4ac6-d50b-4737-b7e4-ebc32635cd6c","2025040852237053.png",280168,"08e61223b82894782eed918587b2b8ae3b4fa6fbbb2b5228bbfebeca395a748a",691,699,"/igenu-preview/media/08e61223b82894782eed9185.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.713Z",[280,283,286],{"_181":192,"_183":281,"_175":194,"_185":282},324,"/igenu-preview/media/5f86a27572b4892ac922fa01.webp",{"_181":197,"_183":284,"_175":194,"_185":285},647,"/igenu-preview/media/56eed4aed7ff6130c91bdc9f.webp",{"_181":275,"_183":276,"_175":194,"_185":287},"/igenu-preview/media/50e8b14977630a4f3e555596.webp",{"_160":211,"_57":289,"_215":290,"_217":291,"_219":292,"_221":246,"_163":293,"_225":295},"ig8300voc","IG8300VOC","IG8300VOC 恶臭与气体在线监测系统","通过多传感器配置监测相关恶臭气体，结合样气预处理、温度补偿与自动校准功能。集成显示、数据存储及通讯，面向污水、化工、垃圾处理等场所的环境在线监测。",{"_57":164,"_223":-5,"_217":116,"_147":-5,"_144":294},{"_103":116,"_147":-5,"_149":-5,"_150":151},{"_160":296,"_140":172,"_173":297,"_175":176,"_177":298,"_179":299,"_181":300,"_183":301,"_185":302,"_187":303,"_189":304},"248b037a-97ca-43b1-abac-a26d2deaf089","2025040852682581.png",22439,"97c97b1129c8237eb4b7d324799035ec948f856036b41f67613d22e0171553b0",194,421,"/igenu-preview/media/97c97b1129c8237eb4b7d324.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.720Z",[305],{"_181":300,"_183":301,"_175":194,"_185":306},"/igenu-preview/media/51378fe539ff38c9e791e3c9.webp","sourceSections",[309],{"_160":310,"_311":312,"_7":313,"_328":-5,"_329":330},"17bf6912-ba28-4754-918c-c564ac4f15fd","type","TEXT_IMAGE",{"_314":38,"_315":165,"_167":38,"_316":317,"_326":327},"body","heading","sourceNotes",[318],{"_103":319,"_320":151,"_167":321,"_322":323,"_324":325},"伊格努-中国服务中心","pending","<p>HARMFUL/FLAMMABLE GAS :-z</p><p>Three basic kinds of hazards</p><p>Oxygen (deficiency and enrichment)</p><p>Flammable gases and vapors</p><p>Toxic contaminants</p><p>OSHA Has Determined Asphyxiation to Be the Leading Cause of Death in Confined Spaces. Air is oxygen deficient whenever concentration is less than 19.5% O2.</p><p>Poisoning</p><p>As an LEL sensor become poisoned the sensors surface and the sensors pores will be coated with oxidized silicone.</p><p>A silicone poisoned sensor will first loose its ability to detect methane, while not exhibiting any noticeable inhibition to detect other combustible gases .</p><p>As poisoning progresses the the LEL sensor will eventually lose is ability to detect any combustible gases.</p><p>Biosystems Toxic Gas Sensors</p><p>Carbon monoxide (CO)</p><p>Hydrogen sulfide (H2S)</p><p>Combination sensors are available</p><p>Sulfur dioxide (SO2)</p><p>Chlorine (Cl2)/chlorine dioxide (ClO2)</p><p>Ammonia (NH3)</p><p>Phosphine (PH3)</p><p>Nitrogen dioxide (NO2)</p><p>Hydrogen cyanide (HCN)</p><p>Nitric oxide (NO)</p>","sourceUrl","http://www.igenu.com/cn/index_2.html","capturedAt","2026-10-21T04:13:22.254Z","imagePosition","right","media","mediaItems",[]]
